 4. Compute the quadratic form $\Delta \mathbf{x}^T \Sigma^{-1} \Delta \mathbf{x}$:
    $$ Q = \Delta \mathbf{x}^T \Sigma^{-1} \Delta \mathbf{x} = C_{00} \Delta x^2 + 2 C_{01} \Delta x \Delta y + C_{11} \Delta y^2 $$
