 5. Compute the exponent:
    $$ E = -0.5 \cdot Q $$
+   [S1, unofficial]
 
 6. Compute the normalization constant:
    $$ Z = 2 \pi \sqrt{\det(\Sigma)} $$
+   [G]
 
 7. Return the PDF value:
    $$ P(\mathbf{xy}) = \frac{\exp(E)}{Z} $$
